{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19147","headline":"和乐天鹦鹉 · 刘禹锡","name":"和乐天鹦鹉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"养来鹦鹉觜初红，宜在朱楼绣户中。\n频学唤人缘性慧，偏能识主爲情通。\n歛毛睡足难销日，嚲翅愁时愿见风。\n谁遣聪明好颜色，事须安置入深笼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"秦岭梅"}